\[ 20 + 25 = 45\% \]

Next, calculate the number of students in each category:
\[ \text{Students in C} = 20\% \times 20 = 0.20 \times 20 = 4 \]
\[ \text{Students in J} = 25\% \times 45 = 0.25 \times 45 = 11.25 \]

Total students who enroll in hip-hop dance:
