\[
20 (\text{first}) + 25 (\text{second}) + 35 (\text{third}) + 60 (\text{fourth})
\]

Calculate the sum:
\[
20 + 25 + 35 + 60 = 130
\]

Thus, the doorbell made a total of:
\[
\boxed{130}
